T:Bonus Carol: Good King Wenceslas
T:TEMPUS ADEST FLORIDUM
C:Music: 13th Century spring carol; first published in the Swedish Piae Cantones, 1582 · Words: John Mason Neale, 1853
S:Open Hymnal Project ABC (openhymnal.org; marked public domain), melody line with every stanza as printed there; their source: 'Carols Old And Carols New', 1916 carol 415.. The hymnary.org score found for comparison (hymnary.org/tune/tempus_adest_floridum) is a different tune or version, so the melody follows the Open Hymnal's source.
